{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/erik_kokalj/status/2105264759687749950","id":"2105264759687749950","text":"GPT 6.1 Sol for video analytics, watching a full airplane turnaround ✈️\n- Sol is near-Astra level at vision at 1/5th the cost, it matched every event Astra found on\n- GPT 6.1 Luna/Terra were >30% less accurate on action recognition\n- Sol also detects ground vehicles (SAM3 on @roboflow tracks them) and logs all states (jet bridge attached, catering at the door, tug connected)\n- Bags on vs off and deboarding vs boarding come from optical flow at native 30fps (cost optimization)\n- Whole 40min turnaround for ~$1","raw_text":{"text":"GPT 6.1 Sol for video analytics, watching a full airplane turnaround ✈️\n- Sol is near-Astra level at vision at 1/5th the cost, it matched every event Astra found on\n- GPT 6.1 Luna/Terra were >30% less accurate on action recognition\n- Sol also detects ground vehicles (SAM3 on @roboflow tracks them) and logs all states (jet bridge attached, catering at the door, tug connected)\n- Bags on vs off and deboarding vs boarding come from optical flow at native 30fps (cost optimization)\n- Whole 40min turnaround for ~$1","display_text_range":[0,513],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[276,285],"original":"roboflow","id":"1144354342532722689"},{"type":"media","indices":[279,302],"id":"2105264586752458753","display":"pic.x.com/LDK1f00cMV","original":"https://t.co/LDK1f00cMV","replacement":"https://x.com/erik_kokalj/status/2105264759687749950/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"erik_kokalj","url":"https://x.com/erik_kokalj","id":"1264289743308763137","followers":560,"following":168,"likes":433,"media_count":20,"name":"Erik Kokalj","description":"Computer Vision & AI - DevEx @Roboflow","raw_description":{"text":"Computer Vision & AI - DevEx @Roboflow","facets":[]},"location":"Slovenia","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1264289743308763137/1790606307","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_im